Civil Revision No. 939 of 2005 
 
 
Md. Zahangir Mollah                .....petitioner 
                               -Versus- 
Md. Azizul Jalal and others  
                                       ......opposite parties   
       
 
 
                                    Mr. Shasti Sarkar with  
