                                    Mr. Justice Bhishmadev Chakrabortty 
 
 
 
      
Civil Revision No. 1726 of 2006 
 
 
Abdul Matlib and another  
                                                ..... petitioners 
                               -Versus- 
Abdul Salik and others  ..... opposite parties   
       
 
 
