Bench: 
                                                  Mr. Justice Bhishmadev Chakrabortty 
 
 
                                         Civil Revision No. 3452 of 2014 
 
                                              Purnima Rani Mandol .....petitioner                         
 
-Versus- 
                                          Debendra Nath Mistry and others 
 
                                                                                  .....opposite parties 
 
 
