Civil Revision No. 1573 of 2012 
 
 
Md. Abdul Jabbar and another 
                                                ......petitioners 
                               -Versus- 
Fatema Khatun and others.  
                                       ......opposite parties   
       
 
 
                                    Mr. SK. Sharifuddin, Advocate  
