In the matter of: 
 
M/S. Jamuna Oil Company Ltd. 
 
 
 
...Petitioner. 
 
 
 
 
 
-Vs- 
Joinab Begum and others. 
 
 
 
 
 
 
...Opposite parties. 
 
 
 
