 IN THE SUPREME COURT OF BANGLADESH 
HIGH COURT DIVISION 
  (CRIMINAL APPELLATE JURISDICTION) 
 
 
              
 
 
  
Criminal Appeal No.  8438 of 2016 
 
 
 
Rashedul Islam alias Bipul and another. 
                   ...Convict-appellants. 
 
 
 
                  -VERSUS- 
