Being aggrieved by and dissatisfied with the impugned 
judgment and order of conviction and sentence dated 
30.06.2019 passed by the learned  Additional Sessions Judge, 
Chapainawabganj in Sessions Case No.1118 of 2017 arising out 
of Gomastapur C.R. Case No.258 of 2017, the convict-

