pay the due amount, however, the convict-appellant did not pay 
the said amount within 30 days and as such the complainant-
respondent No.2 filed a complaint-petition against the convict-
appellant under section 138 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 
1881 before the learned Senior Judicial Magistrate, Cognizance 
Court, Gha Anchol, Chapainawabganj on 10.08.2017 as C.R. 

