disguise of pro-liberation forces came to power and at that time, a 
notorious collaborator namely Shah Azizur Rahman became 
prime minister of newly born Bangladesh and all Pakistani 
notorious collaborators and war criminals came back to 
Bangladesh. During this time, the quota system was though not 
