Fighters were maintained nor the Freedom Fighters were allowed 
to enjoy 30% quota in recruiting process till 1996 i.e. for last 21 
years with deliberate intention of a gradual process for 
elimination of Freedom Fighters from being recruited in the 
service of Republic. Due to such process of elimination, a large 
number of non-Freedom Fighters and even the anti-liberation 
forces occupied all most all services of the Republic and they

