                   Civil Revision No. 4694 of 2022 
Sabina Yasmin Sweety and another 
        ………… Petitioners. 
           -Versus- 
Kajol Rekha being dead her heirs 
Shawkat Akbar and others. 
       
           ……….Opposite parties. 
